# This list is first and foremost a **security** measure, and only secondarily about image size.
#
# backend/samples/MinimalHost/data/ holds a real dev-time admin.db and dev-jwt.key (same for the repo-root data/).
# A naive COPY . . would **bake the signing key and a dev database into an image layer** — once the image is pushed,
# anyone can extract it and forge a super-admin token. So excluding data/ and *.db* is not optional.

.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
artifacts/

# Runtime data (keys / databases / uploads — never goes into the image)
**/data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-*
**/wwwroot/upload/

# Local dev config (contains credentials)
**/appsettings.Development.json
.env.local

# Tooling & agent state
.omc/
.omx/
.codegraph/
.claude/
.dev/

# Docs & scripts (not needed in the image). README.md is NOT excluded: backend/Directory.Build.props uses it
# as the package description page — excluding it would plant a "file not found" landmine in the build, and the
# few KB saved isn't worth it.
docs/
dev.bat
stop.bat
